// The water cap pass and the composite's underwater terms. Every field here is
// the code default written out (crates/pbd-app/src/config.rs); a test holds
// the two together. Omit a field to inherit the default; a zero is a zero.
// Units are in the Rust docs. Names follow Tenebris's water.yaml.
